+# Wire serialisation format
+
+No decision is recorded. `docs/format.md` and `docs/threat-model.md` describe
+the on-disk store (SQLite) and its Markdown/JSONL export, but the project's
+recorded decisions do not name a current wire serialisation format, and
+`docs/threat-model.md` lists team transport across machines as explicitly
+out of scope and not built. Nothing should be assumed until a decision is
+recorded.
